UID:10025916-1784140200-1784147400@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Jam > Grass > Jam: The Saylor Brothers
DESCRIPTION:The Saylor Brothers are a jamgrass fusion group from Asheville\, fronted by brothers Will & Ben Saylor\, of Brushfire Stankgrass. This project is a foray further into the realm of bluegrass jam\, with more emphasis on improvisation piled on top of a structure of traditional bluegrass and innovative original songwriting. As a trio with Greg Stiglets on bass\, the band packs a large sound coming from three acoustic instruments\, and often adds a fourth player for further improvisational and bluegrass firepower.\n\nJam > Grass > Jam is not an open bluegrass jam but is a residency featuring a rotating casts of special guests from Asheville’s bluegrass/jamband scene.\n\nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jam-grass-jam-the-saylor-brothers-3-2-2-2-2-2/2026-07-15/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/IMG_7061-e1746972805618.jpeg
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=French Broad River Brewery 101 Fairview Rd Asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=101 Fairview Rd:geo:-82.5374054,35.5662722
END:VEVENT
